<title>THAILAND: Italian-Thai signs airport earthworks deal.</title>
<headline>Italian-Thai signs airport earthworks deal.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai construction firm Italian-Thai Development Plc said on Monday it had signed a contract worth 11.65 billion baht ($466 million) with the New Bangkok International Airport Co Ltd to do earthworks for the project.  </p>
<p>Under the contract, Italian-Thai will fill in the land for the construction project of the new Bangkok International Airport which will be located in the outskirt of Bangkok, Italian-Thai said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
